### Login admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dam_admin@anzusystems.dev",
  "password": "admin"
}

> {%
  client.global.set('adm_access_token', response.body.access_token)
%}

### Refresh token admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

### Logout admin
GET {{host}}/api/auth/logout?url={{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
